from common import S,X
BIO="Biodegradable waste can be broken down by living things such as bacteria and fungi (food remains, leaves, droppings)::biodegradable,broken down,bacteria,fungi,food,leaves|Nonbiodegradable waste cannot easily be broken down (plastics, glass, metals, rubber)::nonbiodegradable,cannot,plastic,glass,metal,rubber"
COMP="Leaves and food waste are heaped in layers, kept moist and turned to let in air::layers,moist,turn,turned,air,heap|Bacteria and fungi decompose the organic matter using oxygen::bacteria,fungi,decompos,oxygen|A dark crumbly compost forms that is used as manure::dark,crumbly,compost,manure"
DIS="Cholera::cholera|Typhoid::typhoid|Diarrhoea::diarrhoea,diarrhea|Malaria::malaria"
